 <tr style='mso-yfti-irow:6;height:92.25pt'>
  <td width=529 valign=top style='width:284.15pt;border:dotted windowtext 1.0pt;
  border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:dotted windowtext .25pt;mso-border-alt:
  dotted windowtext .25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:92.25pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:2.4pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  2.4pt;margin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:.2gd;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;
  mso-para-margin-bottom:.2gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt'>5. 3 barlık bir basınç ile
  çalışan, 5 lt.lik doldurma <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:2.4pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  2.4pt;margin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:.2gd;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;
  mso-para-margin-bottom:.2gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt'>kapasitesine sahip,
  entegre güvenlik supaplı ve entegre <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:2.4pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  2.4pt;margin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:.2gd;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;
  mso-para-margin-bottom:.2gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt'>hunili piston tipi bir
  basınç göstergesi (manometre) ile teçhiz <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:2.4pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  2.4pt;margin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:.2gd;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;
  mso-para-margin-bottom:.2gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt'>edilmiş püskürtme (sprey)
  cihazı. Bu cihazın, hunili sağlam <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:2.4pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  2.4pt;margin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:.2gd;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;
  mso-para-margin-bottom:.2gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt'>bir haznesi (rezervuarı),
  pirinç pompa çubuğu, ayarlanabilir <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:2.4pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  2.4pt;margin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:.2gd;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;
  mso-para-margin-bottom:.2gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt'>bir püskürtme ağzı ve
  ayarlanabilir bir taşıma kayışı <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:2.4pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  2.4pt;margin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:.2gd;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;
  mso-para-margin-bottom:.2gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt'>bulunmaktadır. <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
  <td width=368 valign=top style='width:197.8pt;border-top:none;border-left:
  none;border-bottom:dotted windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:dotted windowtext 1.0pt;
  mso-border-top-alt:dotted windowtext .25pt;mso-border-left-alt:dotted windowtext .25pt;
  mso-border-alt:dotted windowtext .25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;
  height:92.25pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:2.4pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  2.4pt;margin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:.2gd;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;
  mso-para-margin-bottom:.2gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt'>8424.81 alt pozisyonu <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:2.4pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  2.4pt;margin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:.2gd;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;
  mso-para-margin-bottom:.2gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt'>1 ve 6 no'lu Genel Yorum
  Kuralları <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr style='mso-yfti-irow:7;height:45.15pt'>
  <td width=529 valign=top style='width:284.15pt;border:dotted windowtext 1.0pt;
  border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:dotted windowtext .25pt;mso-border-alt:
  dotted windowtext .25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:45.15pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:2.4pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  2.4pt;margin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:.2gd;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;
  mso-para-margin-bottom:.2gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt'>6. Bilgisayar kontrollü ve
  kutup değiştirme motorlu <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:2.4pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  2.4pt;margin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:.2gd;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;
  mso-para-margin-bottom:.2gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt'>kaydırarak kavislendirme
  (scroll bending) makinaları Tüm <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:2.4pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  2.4pt;margin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:.2gd;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;
  mso-para-margin-bottom:.2gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt'>işlemler soğuk olarak
  gerçekleştirilmektedir. İmalat <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:2.4pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  2.4pt;margin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:.2gd;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;
  mso-para-margin-bottom:.2gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt'>parçasının ucu, bir
  manivela şeklinde tasarlanmış olan <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:2.4pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  2.4pt;margin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:.2gd;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;
